{
  "source": "course-assets/big-upside/big-upside.mp4",
  "duration": 212.5013125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.5,
      "text": "We hear a lot about artificial intelligence, but at its core, AI is essentially a giant calculator."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.16,
      "end": 10.68,
      "text": "It is a system running math at a scale that nobody can easily picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.26,
      "end": 14.74,
      "text": "But that calculator can do some amazing things right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.22,
      "end": 19.82,
      "text": "It can help scientists investigate diseases, assist doctors in finding cancer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.2,
      "end": 22.76,
      "text": "and help someone read a food label they couldn't read before."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.46,
      "end": 28.14,
      "text": "The big upside of this technology isn't a distant promise. It is already happening."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.14,
      "end": 37.52,
      "text": "Inside your body, proteins act as tiny machines. They do countless jobs, from carrying oxygen through your bloodstream to fighting off infections."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.36,
      "end": 42.64,
      "text": "The specific shape of a protein helps determine exactly what it does."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.28,
      "end": 49.74,
      "text": "Knowing a protein's shape can help scientists understand how a disease works and look for new medicines to treat it."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.32,
      "end": 56.74,
      "text": "But figuring out those complex shapes manually was a notoriously slow and difficult job for researchers."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.74,
      "end": 59.78,
      "text": "AlphaFold AI changed the scale."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.68,
      "end": 66.32,
      "text": "Before, we had about 200,000 protein structures determined through decades of experiments."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.92,
      "end": 72.3,
      "text": "Now, there are over 200 million protein structures predicted and shared free."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.16,
      "end": 75.94,
      "text": "But remember, a prediction isn't a finished medicine."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.44,
      "end": 79.3,
      "text": "Scientists still have to test ideas and do the research."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.94,
      "end": 82.08,
      "text": "We see similar acceleration in medicine."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.08,
      "end": 88.8,
      "text": "When doctors examine breast scans, they are looking for tiny visual signs that can be incredibly difficult to spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.46,
      "end": 97.44,
      "text": "In a Swedish trial involving over 100,000 women, doctors using AI found more cancers than those working without it."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.08,
      "end": 100.68,
      "text": "This graphic illustrates how that workflow functions."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.34,
      "end": 104.58,
      "text": "The AI highlights patterns in a scan that deserve a closer look."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.2,
      "end": 107.08,
      "text": "This system does not replace human judgment."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.08,
      "end": 112.88,
      "text": "Doctors examine the highlighted scan, apply their medical expertise, and decide what care is needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.08,
      "end": 117.5,
      "text": "Now think about how often you read something without giving it a second thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.04,
      "end": 121.4,
      "text": "A menu at a restaurant, a food label at the store, or a street sign."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.06,
      "end": 128.26,
      "text": "For someone who is blind or has low vision, accessing that everyday information can be a difficult barrier."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.04,
      "end": 131.04,
      "text": "This diagram shows a practical solution."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.54,
      "end": 135.32,
      "text": "A person points their phone camera to bring a menu or a food label into view."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.32,
      "end": 139.2,
      "text": "The AI recognizes the text on the object and reads it aloud."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.8,
      "end": 141.98,
      "text": "It can also describe the contents of photos."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.82,
      "end": 148.56,
      "text": "Making an everyday, ordinary task easier to navigate provides a profoundly meaningful benefit."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.32,
      "end": 151.78,
      "text": "AI is also providing crucial time."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.46,
      "end": 156.88,
      "text": "For any community sitting in a flood's path, time is the most valuable resource."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.54,
      "end": 164.26,
      "text": "AI helps provide free early warnings, and it is especially useful in regions that lack physical equipment to measure river levels."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.26,
      "end": 169.5,
      "text": "As shown here, predictive modeling allows the AI to provide accurate flood warnings"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.5,
      "end": 170.82,
      "text": "days ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.46,
      "end": 176.28,
      "text": "People get the time they need to prepare and move out of harm's way before the water"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.28,
      "end": 176.84,
      "text": "arrives."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.22,
      "end": 184.08,
      "text": "What do these four distinct examples\u2014investigating disease, finding cancer, reading a label,"
    },
    {
      "start": 184.36,
      "end": 186.52,
      "text": "and preparing for a flood\u2014have in common?"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.3,
      "end": 191.22,
      "text": "In each case, computational power supports human effort."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.22,
      "end": 195.72,
      "text": "Scientists get a starting point. Doctors get help finding something important."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.34,
      "end": 199.96,
      "text": "People get access to information. Communities get time to prepare."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.74,
      "end": 202.88,
      "text": "These are making a difference in people's lives."
    },
    {
      "start": 203.9,
      "end": 205.52,
      "text": "The big upside is happening today."
    },
    {
      "start": 206.1,
      "end": 209.74,
      "text": "AI is already accelerating work that protects and improves lives."
    }
  ],
